  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "住宅計劃",
    "sub_ename": "HOUSING PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "住宅計畫係不動產開發實務之基礎課程。透過對住宅開發、規劃、使用 之講授及解析住宅空間組織與行為等層次和序列關係。建立對空間之組合與分化背景思維，利用案例分析比較，建立住宅設計流程了解文化與科技之取捨。",
    "describe_eh": "The housing plan is foundation of curriculum the real estate development practice。The penetration to the housing development, the plan, the use teaching of and analyzes housing levels and the sequence relations and so on space organization and behavior。The establishment and splits up the background thought to combination of the spatial, compares using the case analysis, establishes the housing design flow understanding culture and the technical choices。",
